---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Services | Causewave Innovations LLP</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/src/styles/global.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50">
  <!-- Navbar -->
  <nav class="bg-white border-b sticky top-0 z-50">
    <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-8 py-5 flex justify-between items-center">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-x-3">
        <img src="/logo_2.png" alt="Causewave" class="h-10 w-auto">
      </a>
      <div class="hidden md:flex gap-x-8 text-sm font-medium">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-sky-600">Home</a>
        <a href="/services" class="text-sky-600 font-semibold">Services</a>
        <a href="/about" class="hover:text-sky-600">About</a>
        <a href="/founder" class="hover:text-sky-600">Leadership</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-sky-600">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Our Services</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">End-to-end CSR support — from strategy to impact reporting.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Services Grid -->
  <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-8 py-20 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
    
    <!-- Service 1 -->
    <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-sky-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-handshake text-3xl text-sky-600"></i>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">CSR Strategy & Compliance</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">We help teams translate CSR intent into eligible, board-ready, and reviewable program plans that align with statutory requirements and company priorities.</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-x-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-1"></i> CSR strategy and annual planning</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-x-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-1"></i> Companies Act CSR compliance support</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-x-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-1"></i> Policy and process review</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-x-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-1"></i> Board and committee inputs</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 2 -->
    <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-sitemap text-3xl text-teal-600"></i>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">Program Design & Budgeting</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">We build detailed program designs across health, education, livelihoods, sustainability, and community development with clear activities, milestones, indicators, and budgets.</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-x-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-1"></i> Need and context mapping</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-x-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-1"></i> Activity and milestone design</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-x-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-1"></i> Output and outcome indicators</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-x-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-500 mt-1"></i> Budget line-item structuring</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Add remaining 4 services similarly -->
    <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-map-marked text-3xl text-emerald-600"></i>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">Field Implementation Support</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">We support the practical middle of CSR work — partner coordination, community workflows, milestones, reviews, and evidence collection during delivery.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl border">
      <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-violet-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-3xl text-violet-600"></i>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">Monitoring & Impact Reporting</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">We define indicators, review rhythm, and evidence requirements to monitor CSR implementation and convert field progress into clear reports for leadership and stakeholders.</p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-20 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold mb-4">Ready to start a project?</h2>
    <a href="/contact" class="inline-block px-10 py-4 bg-white text-slate-900 rounded-3xl font-semibold mt-4">Talk to our team</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>